{
  "_comment": "fetch_many(urls, options): the JSON body sent to POST /v1/fetch (\"body\" cases) and what a success body becomes (\"responses\" cases). Options are named as the SDK arguments (urls, text, max_chars, offset, summary, output_schema, highlights, highlights_query, highlights_max_chars, links, images, max_age, page_timeout, session_id, end_user_id); each SDK maps them to its own spelling. Body rules: urls are sent as given (a lone string is wrapped in a list); content.text is true unless text is false, or {max_chars, offset} with the ones set; summary is {instructions} plus output_schema when given, and output_schema alone is sent as {output_schema} for the API to reject; highlights is true, or {query, max_chars} with the ones set, sent when highlights is true or either detail is set; links and images are sent as given numbers; max_age, page_timeout (as \"timeout\"), session_id and end_user_id are sent as given, an empty string meaning unset. `sent` is the whole body, compared as JSON. Response rules: results and warnings are lists of objects (anything else is []), non-object entries skipped. A result's url is the string sent or \"\"; title, published_at, image, favicon and text are a non-blank string or null; next_offset an integer from 0 to 2^53 - 1 or null (total_chars is not read); summary is a non-blank string, an object, or null; highlights the strings in the list; links [{url, text}] and images [{url, alt}] with url \"\" and text/alt null for anything else. A result's error is null unless it is an object; then its code and message are strings (\"\" otherwise), retryable a boolean (false otherwise), http_status an integer or null. A warning's code, path and message are strings (\"\" otherwise). request_id is the body's non-blank string, else the trimmed X-Request-Id header, else null; latency_ms an integer from 0 or null; session_id a non-blank string or null. `skip` names an SDK whose types cannot express the case, with why.",
  "body": [
    {"name": "one url, no options", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"text": true}}},
    {"name": "several urls in order", "urls": ["https://a.example/", "https://b.example/x", "https://a.example/"], "options": {}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://a.example/", "https://b.example/x", "https://a.example/"], "content": {"text": true}}},
    {"name": "a lone url string is wrapped", "urls": "https://example.com/", "options": {}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"text": true}}, "skip": {"go": "FetchMany takes a []string"}},
    {"name": "text limits", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_chars": 20000, "offset": 20000}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"text": {"max_chars": 20000, "offset": 20000}}}},
    {"name": "max_chars alone", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_chars": 500}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"text": {"max_chars": 500}}}},
    {"name": "text off with a summary", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"text": false, "summary": "List the prices"}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"summary": {"instructions": "List the prices"}}}},
    {"name": "text and a summary together", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"summary": "List the prices"}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"text": true, "summary": {"instructions": "List the prices"}}}},
    {"name": "a summary with an output schema", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"text": false, "summary": "Card fees", "output_schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"pct": {"type": "number"}}}}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"summary": {"instructions": "Card fees", "output_schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"pct": {"type": "number"}}}}}}},
    {"name": "an output schema alone is sent for the API to reject", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"text": false, "output_schema": {"type": "object"}}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"summary": {"output_schema": {"type": "object"}}}}},
    {"name": "highlights with defaults", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"text": false, "highlights": true}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"highlights": true}}},
    {"name": "highlights with a query and a budget", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"text": false, "highlights_query": "pricing", "highlights_max_chars": 3000}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"highlights": {"query": "pricing", "max_chars": 3000}}}},
    {"name": "links and images", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"links": 50, "images": 5}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"text": true, "links": 50, "images": 5}}},
    {"name": "freshness and timeout", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_age": "1d", "page_timeout": "15s"}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"text": true}, "max_age": "1d", "timeout": "15s"}},
    {"name": "always live", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_age": "0s"}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"text": true}, "max_age": "0s"}},
    {"name": "session and end user", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"session_id": "chat-42", "end_user_id": "user_7"}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"text": true}, "session_id": "chat-42", "end_user_id": "user_7"}},
    {"name": "empty strings are unset", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"summary": "", "highlights_query": "", "max_age": "", "page_timeout": "", "session_id": "", "end_user_id": ""}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"text": true}}},
    {"name": "zero links is sent", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"links": 0}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"text": true, "links": 0}}, "skip": {"go": "FetchManyOptions.Links is an int whose zero means unset"}},
    {"name": "every option", "urls": ["https://example.com/"], "options": {"max_chars": 1000, "offset": 10, "summary": "S", "output_schema": {"type": "object"}, "highlights_query": "q", "highlights_max_chars": 200, "links": 3, "images": 2, "max_age": "2h", "page_timeout": "30s", "session_id": "s", "end_user_id": "u"}, "sent": {"urls": ["https://example.com/"], "content": {"text": {"max_chars": 1000, "offset": 10}, "summary": {"instructions": "S", "output_schema": {"type": "object"}}, "highlights": {"query": "q", "max_chars": 200}, "links": 3, "images": 2}, "max_age": "2h", "timeout": "30s", "session_id": "s", "end_user_id": "u"}}
  ],
  "responses": [
    {"name": "a full response", "urls": ["https://e.com/a", "https://e.com/b"], "json": {"request_id": "rid", "latency_ms": 840, "session_id": "s1", "results": [{"url": "https://e.com/a", "title": "A", "published_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z", "image": "https://e.com/i.png", "favicon": "https://e.com/f.ico", "text": "hello", "total_chars": 11, "next_offset": 5, "highlights": ["h1", "h2"], "links": [{"url": "https://e.com/x", "text": "X"}], "images": [{"url": "https://e.com/i.png", "alt": "I"}]}, {"url": "https://e.com/b", "error": {"code": "page_not_found", "message": "404", "retryable": false, "http_status": 404}}], "warnings": [{"code": "duplicate_url", "path": "/urls/2", "message": "dup"}]}, "expect": {"request_id": "rid", "latency_ms": 840, "session_id": "s1", "results": [{"url": "https://e.com/a", "title": "A", "published_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z", "image": "https://e.com/i.png", "favicon": "https://e.com/f.ico", "text": "hello", "next_offset": 5, "summary": null, "highlights": ["h1", "h2"], "links": [{"url": "https://e.com/x", "text": "X"}], "images": [{"url": "https://e.com/i.png", "alt": "I"}], "error": null}, {"url": "https://e.com/b", "title": null, "published_at": null, "image": null, "favicon": null, "text": null, "next_offset": null, "summary": null, "highlights": [], "links": [], "images": [], "error": {"code": "page_not_found", "message": "404", "retryable": false, "http_status": 404}}], "warnings": [{"code": "duplicate_url", "path": "/urls/2", "message": "dup"}]}},
    {"name": "an empty object", "urls": ["https://e.com/a"], "json": {}, "expect": {"request_id": null, "latency_ms": null, "session_id": null, "results": [], "warnings": []}},
    {"name": "a text summary", "urls": ["https://e.com/a"], "json": {"results": [{"url": "https://e.com/a", "summary": "Two tiers"}]}, "expect": {"request_id": null, "latency_ms": null, "session_id": null, "results": [{"url": "https://e.com/a", "title": null, "published_at": null, "image": null, "favicon": null, "text": null, "next_offset": null, "summary": "Two tiers", "highlights": [], "links": [], "images": [], "error": null}], "warnings": []}},
    {"name": "a structured summary", "urls": ["https://e.com/a"], "json": {"results": [{"url": "https://e.com/a", "summary": {"pct": 2.9, "fixed": 0.3}}]}, "expect": {"request_id": null, "latency_ms": null, "session_id": null, "results": [{"url": "https://e.com/a", "title": null, "published_at": null, "image": null, "favicon": null, "text": null, "next_offset": null, "summary": {"pct": 2.9, "fixed": 0.3}, "highlights": [], "links": [], "images": [], "error": null}], "warnings": []}},
    {"name": "mistyped fields", "urls": ["https://e.com/a"], "json": {"latency_ms": -1, "session_id": " ", "results": [1, {"url": 5, "title": 3, "text": ["x"], "total_chars": 1.5, "next_offset": "5", "summary": 7, "highlights": ["ok", 3, null], "links": [{"url": 1, "text": 2}, "x"], "images": [{"url": "u"}], "error": {"code": 4, "retryable": "yes", "http_status": "404"}}, {"url": "https://e.com/c", "error": "x"}], "warnings": "none"}, "expect": {"request_id": null, "latency_ms": null, "session_id": null, "results": [{"url": "", "title": null, "published_at": null, "image": null, "favicon": null, "text": null, "next_offset": null, "summary": null, "highlights": ["ok"], "links": [{"url": "", "text": null}], "images": [{"url": "u", "alt": null}], "error": {"code": "", "message": "", "retryable": false, "http_status": null}}, {"url": "https://e.com/c", "title": null, "published_at": null, "image": null, "favicon": null, "text": null, "next_offset": null, "summary": null, "highlights": [], "links": [], "images": [], "error": null}], "warnings": []}},
    {"name": "the header's request id", "urls": ["https://e.com/a"], "headers": {"X-Request-Id": " hdr "}, "json": {}, "expect": {"request_id": "hdr", "latency_ms": null, "session_id": null, "results": [], "warnings": []}}
